21)--------------------------HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, on=[(sr_customer_sk@2, ss_customer_sk@2), (sr_item_sk@1, ss_item_sk@1), (sr_ticket_number@3, ss_ticket_number@4)], projection=[ss_sold_date_sk@5, ss_item_sk@6, ss_store_sk@8, ss_quantity@10, sr_returned_date_sk@0, sr_item_sk@1, sr_customer_sk@2, sr_return_quantity@4]
